### Create a weekly schedule (Mon-Fri 09:00-18:00 with a lunch break, Sat 10:00-15:00)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/schedules
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "name": "Ofis ish vaqti",
  "timezone": "Asia/Tashkent",
  "slots": [
    { "dayOfWeek": "MONDAY", "startTime": "09:00", "endTime": "13:00" },
    { "dayOfWeek": "MONDAY", "startTime": "14:00", "endTime": "18:00" },
    { "dayOfWeek": "TUESDAY", "startTime": "09:00", "endTime": "18:00" },
    { "dayOfWeek": "WEDNESDAY", "startTime": "09:00", "endTime": "18:00" },
    { "dayOfWeek": "THURSDAY", "startTime": "09:00", "endTime": "18:00" },
    { "dayOfWeek": "FRIDAY", "startTime": "09:00", "endTime": "18:00" },
    { "dayOfWeek": "SATURDAY", "startTime": "10:00", "endTime": "15:00" }
  ]
}

### List schedules
POST http://localhost:8080/api/schedules/list
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{ "page": 0, "size": 20 }

### Is it open right now?
GET http://localhost:8080/api/schedules/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Add this year's fixed public holidays
POST http://localhost:8080/api/holidays/fixed?year=2027
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### A shortened pre-holiday day
POST http://localhost:8080/api/holidays
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{ "date": "2027-03-20", "name": "Navro'z arafasi", "kind": "SHORT_DAY", "openTime": "09:00", "closeTime": "14:00" }

### Holidays of one year
POST http://localhost:8080/api/holidays/list
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{ "year": 2027 }
